Subject: [PATCH/RFC v2 1/4] ARM: shmobile: r8a7791 dtsi: Move DIV6 and MSTP clocks under CPG
Message-Id: <1442936646-30362-2-git-send-email-geert+renesas@glider.be>
List-Id: <linux-sh.vger.kernel.org>
References: <1442936646-30362-1-git-send-email-geert+renesas@glider.be>
In-Reply-To: <1442936646-30362-1-git-send-email-geert+renesas@glider.be>
MIME-Version: 1.0
